Subject: [PATCH 1/7] =?UTF-8?q?fix-bottomnav-label:=20GNB=20=ED=94=84?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EB=A1=9C=EA=B7=B8=EB=9E=98=EC=8B=9C=EB=B8=8C=20=EB=9D=BC?=
